### Extended-Catalog Finding

#### 10. Assertion Roulette
**File:** `OrderProcessorTests.cs` · **Method:** `CalculateTotal_ReturnsCorrectAmount` (line 70)
```csharp
Assert.AreEqual(247.50m, order.TotalAmount);   // which one failed?
Assert.AreEqual(22.28m, order.TaxAmount);
Assert.AreEqual(269.78m, order.GrandTotal);
```
**Problem:** Three assertions, zero descriptive messages. A CI failure log shows only the expected/actual mismatch — you have to read the source to know which property was wrong.
**Fix:** Add message parameters:
```csharp
Assert.AreEqual(expectedSubtotal, order.TotalAmount, "Subtotal mismatch");
Assert.AreEqual(expectedTax, order.TaxAmount, "Tax mismatch");
Assert.AreEqual(expectedTotal, order.GrandTotal, "Grand-total mismatch");
```

